<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Your market visibility goes dark TOMORROW!!!</mj-title>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body background-color="#FFFFFF">
    <mj-wrapper css-class="container" padding="0">
      <adv-header />

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          Hi <span>{{ first_name }}, </span>
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          Over the past two weeks, your <strong>Advantage Reports</strong> for
          <a href="{{ product_link }}">{{ product_title }}</a> have tracked
          every meaningful move in your competitive landscape.
        </mj-text>
      </para>
      <para>
        <mj-text>
          Price shifts, listing changes, new entrants, review momentum – you’ve
          had 20/20 vision of everything going on.</mj-text
        >
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          <strong>Your FREE trial ends tomorrow.</strong>
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para classes="greeting-text">
        <mj-text>
          Here’s what that means: the competitors we’ve been tracking for you
          won’t pause. They’ll keep adjusting prices, running promotions, and
          optimizing listings – and without
          <strong
            >Am<span style="color: #088ab2; text-decoration: underline">ai</span
            >zing</strong
          >, you’ll be back to:
          <span style="font-style: italic"
            >“My sales dropped and I don’t know why.</span
          >”
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <ai-btn-ico
        classes="btn-wrapper"
        href="{{ stripe_link }}"
        iconSrc="https://app-stg.amaizing.io/pngs/check-circle-broken.png"
        >Subscribe Now</ai-btn-ico
      >

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          Plans start at <strong>$60/month per Hero ASIN.</strong> That’s less
          than the cost of a single missed competitor move (most brands lose
          5-15% of potential revenue to invisible market shifts).
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          Questions about which plan is right for you? Just reply to this email.
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          Some brands guess. The best see clearly. Be the best.
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para classes="greeting-text">
        <mj-text> Thanks, </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          The
          <strong
            >Am<span style="color: #088ab2; text-decoration: underline">ai</span
            >zing</strong
          >
          Team
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <adv-footer />
    </mj-wrapper>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
